1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Having a backup does not mean a bank can recover
a critical workload when it actually matters.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Which recovery assumption fails first —
and what action is justified next?

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:23,000
This is Systemic Resilience Copilot.
Apertus turns messy language into structured evidence.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Transparent rules control the decision,
so missing evidence stays UNKNOWN.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,500
Our synthetic retail-payments workload
has a sixty-minute recovery tolerance.

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:49,000
The recovery route is independent,
supports the same workload, and has been tested.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
But observed recovery takes ninety-five minutes.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Apertus extracts stated facts;
the host validates them before rules run.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The rule chain stops at the first binding condition.
Recovery independence passes. Execution does not.

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Ninety-five minutes is longer than sixty.

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:25,000
The first binding state is B two, at S five.
Repair execution and retest.

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Apertus reviews the fixed decision,
challenges it, and surfaces missing evidence.

13
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:45,000
It cannot overwrite the deterministic state.
AI explains. Rules decide.

14
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:54,000
We repair only the execution problem.
Recovery now completes in forty-five minutes.

15
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:05,000
S five turns green, but the next unresolved condition
appears: S six, simultaneous recovery demand.

16
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Only now do we open the systemic lens.
Three institutions may need the same recovery fabric.

17
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:22,500
Recovery passes, but assured capacity,
priority and coordination are not established.

18
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:31,000
The correct result is S seven UNKNOWN.
The tool refuses to invent a shortage.

19
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:37,500
Systemic Resilience Copilot turns messy evidence
into a traceable next action.

20
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:43,000
Apertus structures and explains.
When the evidence stops, the inference stops.
